'' ONE POOL SERVES EVERY PROJECT (RFC-0005 §4): two programs in different directories import
'' std/strings from the toolchain's pkg/ with the same options, so the first builds it and
'' the second takes the first's entry. Nothing is made beside either project.
'' TEST: cli
'' ENV: TKO_MODCACHE=build/.mct-share/cache
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/win64-msvc
'' CLEAN: build/.mct-share
'' STEP: -v -target win64-msvc tests/driver/src/modshare/one/main.bas -o build/.mct-share/one.exe
'' STEP-OUT: module std.strings: miss (new)
'' ARGS: -v -target win64-msvc tests/driver/src/modshare/two/main.bas -o build/.mct-share/two.exe
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: module std.strings: hit
'' RUN: build/.mct-share/two.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: cdcdcd
